A simple **safe-edge** decision rule consistent with the above is:
[
e^* \in \arg\min_{e\in \mathrm{Out}(p_q)}\Big(\lambda_r,R(e,o_q)+\lambda_t,T(e)+\lambda_q,Q(e)\Big)
\quad \text{s.t.}\quad \text{edge-order & custody constraints hold.}
]
Here (R) is sightline/risk cost, (T) is traversal time, and (Q) is queue/chokepoint penalty.

