### Proofs, rollups, and uplink behavior

**proof-artifact**: An individual evidence item (photo, sketch, timestamp basisline, attestation) used to support a claim tied to an exit edge—subject to redaction/minimization.

**proof-bundle**: A curated, hashed, minimally scoped collection of proof-artifacts bound to a specific exit-edge stamp id and snapshot-id; it supports consentful reveal and audit readiness.
